# One key per person. A # line names the key on the next line; the name only
# shows up in the server's log. Make each key with: openssl rand -hex 32
# Keys shorter than 16 characters are skipped, so the placeholders below do
# nothing and a copy of this file left as it is won't start a server.
# Edit this file while the server runs and the change takes effect within
# 10 seconds.

#friend1
keypasshere

#friend2
keypasshere

#friend3
keypasshere
